## Original Text
{{ chapter_text }}

## Repair Rules
1. Only modify issue location paragraphs, evidence paragraphs, and necessary opening/closing windows; keep unquoted paragraphs as-is.
2. If issues are opening_gap / bridge_contract_not_followed / location_jump, prioritize supplementing time, location, POV, action handoff, emotional aftermath, and transition causality within the first 300-500 characters.
3. If issues are forbidden_element, must use completely different imagery/patterns; do not use near-synonym replacements.
4. Repaired text word count must be between {{ word_count_min }}-{{ word_count_max }}.
5. Forbidden: new POV segments, unplanned character positive actions, forbidden changed events, future chapter revelations, or large padding sections.
6. Do not write explanations, reports, JSON, or repair notes; text must be complete.
